---
title: Submit a Project
description: >-
  How to submit your team's Battle of the Counties entry, what to prepare before you open the form, and what judges want to see in your Virtual Tour.
noindex: true
---
{% extends "layouts/base.njk" %}

{% block head %}
<style>
  /* ── SUBMISSION CHECKLIST ────────────────────────────────────── */
  .submit-checklist {
    display: flex; flex-direction: column;
    max-width: 720px; margin-top: 48px;
  }
  .submit-item {
    display: grid; grid-template-columns: 48px 1fr;
    gap: 24px; align-items: start;
    padding: 28px 0;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--soft);
  }
  .submit-item:last-child { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--soft); }
  .submit-num {
    font-family: 'Big Shoulders Display', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 900; font-size: 32px;
    color: var(--red); line-height: 1; padding-top: 4px;
  }
  .submit-item-title {
    font-family: 'Big Shoulders Display', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 700; font-size: 22px;
    color: var(--ink); line-height: 1.1; margin-bottom: 8px;
  }
  .submit-item-body { font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.65; color: var(--gray); }

  /* ── FORM SECTION ────────────────────────────────────────────── */
  .submit-form-wrap { max-width: 600px; margin: 48px auto 0; text-align: center; }
  .submit-deadline {
    font-family: 'Pixelify Sans', sans-serif; font-size: 13px;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em; text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--gray); margin-top: 24px;
  }

  /* ── RESPONSIVE ──────────────────────────────────────────────── */
  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .submit-item { grid-template-columns: 36px 1fr; gap: 16px; }
    .submit-num { font-size: 24px; }
  }
</style>
{% endblock %}

{% block content %}

<!-- HERO -->
<div class="page-hero">
  <div class="page-hero-content">
    <div class="page-hero-eyebrow">Submit a Project</div>
    <h1 class="page-hero-h1">Submit your team's entry.</h1>
    <p class="page-hero-sub">
      The team advisor registers and submits one entry per school. Have your Virtual Tour and team information ready before you open the form. Submissions close November 15, 2026 (Pacific Time).
    </p>
    <div class="page-hero-cta">
      <a href="#submit-form" class="btn-cream">Go to the Form</a>
      <a href="#what-to-prepare" class="btn-ghost-civic">What to Prepare →</a>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="page-hero-visual">
    <img src="/assets/kids-collage.png" alt="Students competing in Battle of the Counties">
  </div>
</div>

<!-- DATE TICKER -->
<div class="ticker">
  <div class="ticker-lbl">Key Dates</div>
  <div class="ticker-items">
    <div class="ticker-event"><span class="ticker-date">SEPT 22</span><span class="ticker-name">World goes live</span></div>
    <div class="ticker-event"><span class="ticker-date">NOV 15</span><span class="ticker-name">Submissions close (Pacific Time)</span></div>
    <div class="ticker-event"><span class="ticker-date">JAN 9, 2027</span><span class="ticker-name">Statewide Championship</span></div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- WHAT TO PREPARE -->
<section id="what-to-prepare" class="sec sec-cream">
  <h2 class="sec-h2 sec-h2-dark page-h2 h2-body">What to have ready.</h2>
  <p class="sec-intro">
    Before you open the form, make sure you have the following on hand.
  </p>
  <div class="submit-checklist">
    <div class="submit-item">
      <div class="submit-num">01</div>
      <div>
        <div class="submit-item-title">School and advisor</div>
        <p class="submit-item-body">Your school name, plus the name and email of the adult advisor submitting for the team.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="submit-item">
      <div class="submit-num">02</div>
      <div>
        <div class="submit-item-title">Division and challenge</div>
        <p class="submit-item-body">Your team's division (grades 3–5, 6–8, or 9–12; all four students must be in the same division) and which of the <a href="/#challenges">seven challenges</a> it chose. A team name is optional.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="submit-item">
      <div class="submit-num">03</div>
      <div>
        <div class="submit-item-title">Project Title and Brief Project Summary</div>
        <p class="submit-item-body">A title for the proposal and a short summary of what the team created, who it serves, and how it responds to the challenge. The summary gives judges context. It is not scored.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="submit-item">
      <div class="submit-num">04</div>
      <div>
        <div class="submit-item-title">Your Virtual Tour (MP4)</div>
        <p class="submit-item-body">An MP4 video, 3 minutes or less, uploaded directly through the form. It walks judges through your build, Board, and NPC. Every team member's voice must be heard. With teacher approval, a student may contribute through captions or on-screen text instead of speaking. Teams do not submit their Minecraft world. See below for what judges want to see.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="submit-item">
      <div class="submit-num">05</div>
      <div>
        <div class="submit-item-title">Two advisor confirmations</div>
        <p class="submit-item-body">The advisor confirms that they reviewed the full rubric and the Virtual Tour is ready, and that required student permissions, including use of each student's voice and likeness, are on file with the school, district, or county office of education. The Level Up Civics Foundation does not collect permission forms.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- WHAT THE VIDEO NEEDS TO COVER -->
<section class="sec sec-navy">
  <h2 class="sec-h2 sec-h2-light page-h2 h2-body">What the Virtual Tour needs to cover.</h2>
  <p class="sec-intro sec-intro-light sec-intro-mb">
    Judges score the Virtual Tour using the Battle Prompt &amp; Rubric for your team's challenge and division. A strong tour covers all four criteria, plus anything else your Battle Prompt asks for.
  </p>
  <div class="grid-4">
    <div class="card">
      <div class="card-eyebrow card-eyebrow-red">Challenge</div>
      <h3 class="card-title card-title-light">What need did you address?</h3>
      <p class="card-body card-body-light">Name the need, strength, or opportunity your team addressed. Tell who your idea serves and why it matters.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <div class="card-eyebrow card-eyebrow-red">Learning &amp; Evidence</div>
      <h3 class="card-title card-title-light">What did you learn?</h3>
      <p class="card-body card-body-light">Explain what you learned in the community and how it shaped your design. In grades 9–12, use your external source to justify key choices.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <div class="card-eyebrow card-eyebrow-red">Design &amp; Creativity</div>
      <h3 class="card-title card-title-light">Show the build.</h3>
      <p class="card-body card-body-light">Walk judges through your build and its purposeful features. Show how the features work together as a solution.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <div class="card-eyebrow card-eyebrow-red">Communication &amp; Team Voice</div>
      <h3 class="card-title card-title-light">Make the case together.</h3>
      <p class="card-body card-body-light">Show your Board and NPC, and include every team member's voice. With teacher approval, a student may use captions or on-screen text instead of speaking.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- SUBMIT -->
<section id="submit-form" class="sec sec-cream">
  <div class="sec-header">
    <h2 class="sec-h2 sec-h2-dark page-h2">Submit your entry.</h2>
    <p class="sec-header-intro">
      One submission per school, completed by the team advisor. Registration and submission happen together in the Official Team Submission form. Submissions are visible to judges and admins only, and nothing is posted publicly without permissions.
    </p>
  </div>
  <div class="submit-form-wrap">
    <a href="https://levelupcivics.ekadence.com/levelupcivicssurvey" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn-primary" style="display: inline-block;">Open the Official Team Submission Form →</a>
    <p style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.65; color: var(--gray); margin-top: 16px;">Questions? <a href="mailto:info@levelupcivicsfoundation.org">info@levelupcivicsfoundation.org</a></p>
    <p class="submit-deadline">Submissions close November 15, 2026 (Pacific Time)</p>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- CTA BAND -->
<div class="cta-band">
  <div class="cta-band-inner">
    <h2 class="cta-band-h2">Questions about the competition?</h2>
    <p class="cta-band-body">
      Read the Competition Guide &amp; FAQ for the full details, or reach out at info@levelupcivicsfoundation.org.
    </p>
    <div class="cta-band-btns">
      <a href="/assets/downloads/Battle_of_the_Counties_Competition_Guide_and_FAQ_2026-27.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn-white">Competition Guide &amp; FAQ</a>
      <a href="/" class="btn-ghost-white">Battle of the Counties →</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

{% endblock %}
